    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the world of <i>Novath</i>, a turn-based tactical RPG adventure where your decisions determine your destiny. Train to become the greatest warrior in the land as three great nations teeter on the brink of war.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Classic Turn-Based Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in classic, tactical turn-based battles with a party of your choosing. Each class has unique skills, strengths, and weaknesses to learn and exploit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995960/extras/ad236f4f5759cb947cee0b4cdd68c175.avif?t=1754023835\" width=616 height=234 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build the Party You Believe In</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Subdue enemies through battle and force them to join your ranks\u2014or win over story-rich characters whose loyalty must be earned through choices and consequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995960/extras/e4a1654bf90dae3444f0497aa163f67f.avif?t=1754023835\" width=616 height=234 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Living World that Judges You</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The continent of <i>Novath</i> simmers with history and unrest. Your choices\u2014who you slay, who you spare, and who you subjugate\u2014will shift how characters treat you, alter relationships, and open or close narrative paths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995960/extras/c56e058688cfe411508f0bb1b9956b7c.avif?t=1754023835\" width=616 height=234 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the world of <i>Novath</i>, a turn-based tactical RPG adventure where your decisions determine your destiny. Train to become the greatest warrior in the land as three great nations teeter on the brink of war.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Classic Turn-Based Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in classic, tactical turn-based battles with a party of your choosing. Each class has unique skills, strengths, and weaknesses to learn and exploit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995960/extras/ad236f4f5759cb947cee0b4cdd68c175.avif?t=1754023835\" width=616 height=234 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build the Party You Believe In</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Subdue enemies through battle and force them to join your ranks\u2014or win over story-rich characters whose loyalty must be earned through choices and consequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995960/extras/e4a1654bf90dae3444f0497aa163f67f.avif?t=1754023835\" width=616 height=234 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Living World that Judges You</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The continent of <i>Novath</i> simmers with history and unrest. Your choices\u2014who you slay, who you spare, and who you subjugate\u2014will shift how characters treat you, alter relationships, and open or close narrative paths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2995960/extras/c56e058688cfe411508f0bb1b9956b7c.avif?t=1754023835\" width=616 height=234 /></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Slay. Spare. Subjugate. Novath is a single-player, story-rich turn-based RPG set in a fractured medieval fantasy world. Assemble your party from enemies and allies alike. Shape the story through choices that echo across the continent. Your path is yours to forge.",
